summary.text:
I need produce JSON only. Should design CODESYS FB with vars previous_demand, episode_served initial conditions LeadA true. Declaration FUNCTION_BLOCK FB_Task VAR_INPUT Demand BOOL etc VAR_OUTPUT PumpA BOOL; LeadA BOOL := TRUE; END_VAR VAR previous_demand BOOL := FALSE; episode_served BOOL := FALSE; END_VAR. implementation behavior.

Should be careful with CODESYS output init allowed. body each scan default pumps false. If Demand then select lead preference current LeadA, healthy fallback. If either runs set episode_served TRUE. Else no. previous_demand update, falling edge: IF previous_demand AND NOT Demand THEN IF episode_served THEN LeadA := NOT LeadA; END_IF; episode_served := FALSE; END_IF. Also on rising/new demand? episode_served should be false from initialization and reset falling edge. If Demand held true initial good. Could robustly reset on NOT previous_demand AND Demand? Not necessary but if weird. Requirements continuous episodes. Set episode_served false when no demand and no previous? On initial false remains false. At falling reset. Fine.

Ordering outputs no demand off. Toggle on falling edge. Use ELSIF? Structure:
PumpA := FALSE; PumpB := FALSE;
IF Demand THEN
 IF LeadA THEN
  IF NOT FaultA THEN PumpA := TRUE;
  ELSIF NOT FaultB THEN PumpB := TRUE; END_IF;
 ELSE ...
 END_IF;
 IF PumpA OR PumpB THEN episode_served := TRUE; END_IF;
END_IF;
IF previous_demand AND NOT Demand THEN
 IF episode_served THEN LeadA := NOT LeadA; END_IF;
 episode_served := FALSE;
END_IF;
previous_demand := Demand;

Fault immediate fallback yes. No both. Lead output retained. supporting_objects [] .

Exact JSON valid string newlines escaped or can include \n. Only object. Ensure declaration omit END_FUNCTION_BLOCK. Could include VAR_OUTPUT LeadA : BOOL := TRUE; initial previous. Names exact. CODESYS syntax FUNCTION_BLOCK FB_Task (no semicolon typically). Standard.

Potential first variable mentioned atomic first but not required. No need. Implementation alone.

Check fallback test episode first all fault no served, falling no toggle. Next demand LeadA true A fault B healthy B. Then A healthy chooses A. episode served true. falling toggles false. Good.

One subtlety episode_served set only while demand. If previously served and current Demand false, output off and toggle. fine.

Return JSON.

